<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina says set $6.12 bln reverse repos Friday.</title>
<headline>Argentina says set $6.12 bln reverse repos Friday.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Monday it set $6.12 billion in overnight reverse repurchase agreements June 27.</p>
<p>The reverse repos were set at 5.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>(( Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0657))</p>
</text>
